      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Gloracia is a tree-house style play station in Play Yellow. It has palm towers, a slide, a swing and a climbing net, plus an activity arm reaching out from the main tower. Children climb the net, hang from the arm and come down the slide, so the play is active without being spread too wide. The product area is 23'8\" x 20'1\", with a safe play area of 29'8\" x 26'1\", which fits a mid-sized society garden or school ground. Children from 3 to 12 can use it. Apart from Play Yellow, it is offered in Play Orange and Lemon Yellow, and capacity is listed as 15 children. Gloracia comes with a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Send us photos of your site for a layout."
